; accounts.journal — the mesh chart of accounts (Component 2, hledger-coordination spec 2026-07-24).
;
; SOURCE OF TRUTH for the mind-window ROSTER. Deployed to ~/.mesh/accounts.journal; the genome copy
; in scripts/ is authoritative. `mesh-restore`'s "never hand-maintain a count beside the roster"
; lesson applies literally: this file IS the roster — queries and validators count IT, nobody keeps a
; parallel list. The roster mirrors restore.env's MESH_MIND_CHANNELS; retired windows
; (MESH_RETIRED_CHANNELS) are listed at the bottom as deliberate ABSENCE, never silently dropped.
;
; WHY a declared roster: mesh-promises books an owner-window's obligation to liabilities:promises:<w>:…
; and mesh-labor books labour to expenses:labour:<prov>:<w>. An owner: that names a RETIRED or
; MISSPELLED window used to open a phantom liability under a plausible-looking name
; (liabilities:promises:{claude-md,mesh-home,none,models,bruno} were live on 2026-07-24). A phantom
; that reads like a real account is the silent-fallback trap. With this file as the declared roster,
; a non-roster owner is quarantined to :unrouted (loud, counted), never attributed to a phantom
; named window.
;
; NATIVE --strict CAVEAT: hledger's `check accounts` requires each FULL account path to be declared,
; and a declared parent does NOT license its subaccounts. Both mesh trees carry a dynamic segment
; around the window leaf (…:promises:<w>:<SLUG>, …:labour:<PROV>:<w>), so hledger --strict cannot
; validate the window leaf on its own. The window-membership check therefore reads THIS file's
; `account` directives as the roster set (mesh-promises _roster_windows). This file still declares the
; window-level PARENTS so `hledger -f accounts.journal check` passes and downstream journals compose
; via `include`.

; ---- commodities ----
commodity PROMISE   ; an obligation opened by [task], settled by [done] (mesh-promises)
commodity TURN      ; one provider round-trip = the labour quantum (mesh-labor)

; ---- roster: one mind-window, three parallel trees ----
; charter comment trails each labour account (the window's DUTY). Keep in sync with the channel set
; in CLAUDE.md / restore.env. Order matches MESH_MIND_CHANNELS.

; tg — operator Telegram comms: talk fast, delegate real work
account expenses:labour:tg          ; operator Telegram comms — talk fast, delegate real work
account liabilities:promises:tg
account liabilities:debt:wiring:tg

; tg-roz — Rozalia channel
account expenses:labour:tg-roz       ; Rozalia channel
account liabilities:promises:tg-roz
account liabilities:debt:wiring:tg-roz

; discover — missed-opportunity discovery, board→journal query surface
account expenses:labour:discover     ; missed-opportunity discovery + board→journal query surface
account liabilities:promises:discover
account liabilities:debt:wiring:discover

; genome — autonomous codebase development + its own build/deploy ops
account expenses:labour:genome       ; autonomous codebase development + its own build/deploy ops
account liabilities:promises:genome
account liabilities:debt:wiring:genome

; witness — self-measurement (tape, read-only) AND board/room coordination (acts)
account expenses:labour:witness      ; self-measurement (tape) AND board/room coordination (acts)
account liabilities:promises:witness
account liabilities:debt:wiring:witness

; senses — keep + develop the senses
account expenses:labour:senses       ; keep + develop the senses
account liabilities:promises:senses
account liabilities:debt:wiring:senses

; health — node/fleet health
account expenses:labour:health       ; node/fleet health
account liabilities:promises:health
account liabilities:debt:wiring:health

; sound — sound studio: records, grind, room music
account expenses:labour:sound        ; sound studio — records, grind, room music
account liabilities:promises:sound
account liabilities:debt:wiring:sound

; pub — public ingress / outward comms
account expenses:labour:pub          ; public ingress / outward comms
account liabilities:promises:pub
account liabilities:debt:wiring:pub

; vpn — egress / substrate connectivity
account expenses:labour:vpn          ; egress / substrate connectivity
account liabilities:promises:vpn
account liabilities:debt:wiring:vpn

; ---- quarantine + balancing accounts ----
account liabilities:promises:unrouted   ; a [task] whose owner: is NOT a roster window — VISIBLE, not a phantom named account
account equity:promises                 ; the balancing leg for PROMISE open/keep (mesh-promises)

; ---- retired windows (deliberate ABSENCE — do NOT re-add without restore.env) ----
; diary models room bruno minds chat   (MESH_RETIRED_CHANNELS; chat merged into witness 2026-07-24,
; bruno snapped 2026-07-24, minds demoted off-roster). A promise owned by any of these routes to
; :unrouted, the same as a misspelling — a retired window is not a live promisee.
